        "id": 3438316
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-08-14T14:26:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree it\u0027s not ideal, I like the copy-on-write idea, and would also be nice to get GPU buffer support working for Graphite. I think it would be simpler to work on those as a follow up though so we can constrain the logic for that in a CL. I created b/545647152 to address this as future work.",
      "parentUuid": "e6ee7123_f7a87b83",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 991,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1006,
        "endChar": 0
